# Baseline handles: conditional rules already covered by an unconditional one.
SUBJECT admin, support
RESOURCE tickets SUPPORTS READ, WRITE, EXECUTE
RESOURCE kb SUPPORTS READ, WRITE

ALLOW admin ACCESS tickets
ALLOW admin EXECUTE tickets WHEN mfa
ALLOW admin WRITE tickets WHEN business_hours
ALLOW support READ tickets
ALLOW support READ tickets WHEN on_shift
ALLOW support WRITE tickets WHEN on_shift
ALLOW support READ kb
